      "writtenOn": "2024-04-05T06:34:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ah, so the gatekeeperd \u003c-\u003e HAL service hop is `-ndk` but the HAL service \u003c-\u003e TA hop is `-cpp`?\n\nHow is the latter going to cope with the `-cpp` targets not being stable?  If a new dessert release changes the `-cpp` generated code, then the HAL service will use the new code but the TA will still be expecting the old code?",
      "parentUuid": "654f91b1_591ba913",
      "revId": "07a5cf186494c04e069e9b81681f259781849f0c",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
