      "writtenOn": "2024-04-05T21:16:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We\u0027re linking these into vendor code and marked them `vendor_available` on line 12.\nWhat this means is we get separate vendor copies of both the interface library and libbinder itself, named something like `android.hardware.gatekeeper-V1-cpp.vendor` and `libbinder.vendor`, respectively. Both of those live on the vendor partition and get updated together with the code that uses them, so updates shouldn\u0027t break them.",
      "parentUuid": "c7bae0f3_cef05ae6",
      "revId": "07a5cf186494c04e069e9b81681f259781849f0c",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
